{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3144440/extras/gif_cut.gif?t=1744514276\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>The Beginning of the Mystery</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Embark on your journey into the universe of <i>Reaper Rules</i> with this first episode, where mystery and challenge collide. Dive into an intriguing story, with choices that will shape your destiny. Explore an immersive world filled with secrets, facing a variety of challenges that will test your skills. Get ready to unravel mysteries and make tough decisions in an experience that will leave an impact. Are you ready for the beginning of the unknown?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mysterious Story</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A 2D narrative adventure game with varied gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Intriguing characters</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Episodes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game is divided into episodes, create your theories until the next episode is released!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Beyond the story, the game offers stages with a variety of gameplay, from narrative adventure-focused ones to the more challenging ones.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Respect for the elders!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3144440/b931735eb6d571750d0a14ad66f8162f22a083c4.jpg"},{"name":"You should be ashamed of yourself!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3144440/6f9e4d698d8b655b9f7a3957cdac4fc14498b3cf.jpg"},{"name":"Thanks for the love <3